From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tab S9 FE Linux Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:40:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ANDROID: gpu: qos: declare flag helper as bool

The helper is used exclusively as a predicate.  Declare its omitted return
type explicitly instead of relying on C's obsolete implicit-int behaviour.

Signed-off-by: Tab S9 FE Linux Project <noreply@example.invalid>
---
 drivers/gpu/arm/exynos/backend/gpexbe_qos_internal.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/arm/exynos/backend/gpexbe_qos_internal.h b/drivers/gpu/arm/exynos/backend/gpexbe_qos_internal.h
--- a/drivers/gpu/arm/exynos/backend/gpexbe_qos_internal.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/arm/exynos/backend/gpexbe_qos_internal.h
@@ -18,6 +18,6 @@
  * http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html.
  */
 
-static inline pmqos_flag_check(mali_pmqos_flags type, mali_pmqos_flags in)
+static inline bool pmqos_flag_check(mali_pmqos_flags type, mali_pmqos_flags in)
 {
 	return (type & in) == in;
-- 
2.50.1
